msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_A2_000_001:1"
msgid "Undertake this quest as <if ($gn68 == 10)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 14)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 5)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 26)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else><if ($gn68 == 33)>an <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0><else>a <sheet ClassJob $gn68 0></if></if></if></if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 作成したいマンダヴィルウェポンに応じたジョブとなり、<br>再度、マンダヴィル家の職人に声をかけてください。
#. de: Bitte sprich den Handwerker der Mandervilles erneut an, wenn du bereit bist, diesen Auftrag anzunehmen.
#. fr: Sélectionnez le job de votre choix puis reparlez à l'artisan des Manderville.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_SYSTEM_120_000:1"
msgid "Please speak with the House Manderville artisan again when you are ready to undertake this quest."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」および、<br>「<sheet Item $n2 0>」はすでに取得済みです。<br>ほかのジョブとなり、再度話しかけてください。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> und <noun-de Item 2 $n2 1 4 1> bereits erlangt. Wechsle zu einem anderen Job und sprich erneut mit dem Handwerker der Mandervilles.
#. fr: Vous possédez déjà <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1> et <noun-fr Item 2 $n2 1 1>. Sélectionnez un autre job et reparlez à l'artisan des Manderville.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n2 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 2, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_SYSTEM_130_000:1"
msgid "You have already received <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> and <noun-en Item 2 $n2 1 1>. Please change to a different job and speak with the House Manderville artisan again."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」はすでに取得済みです。<br>ほかのジョブとなり、再度話しかけてください。
#. de: Du hast <noun-de Item 2 $n1 1 4 1> bereits erlangt. Wechsle zu einem anderen Job und sprich erneut mit dem Handwerker der Mandervilles.
#. fr: Vous possédez déjà <noun-fr Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Sélectionnez un autre job et reparlez à l'artisan des Manderville.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 2, row = number parameter 1, count = 1, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_SYSTEM_140_000:1"
msgid "You have already received <noun-en Item 2 $n1 1 1>. Please change to a different job and speak with the House Manderville artisan again."
msgstr ""

#. ja: マンダヴィルウェポンの製作ですね！<br>お待ちしていました、準備はできています。<br>その……「<sheet Item 38420 0>」以外は。
#. de: Seid gegrüßt, <if $gn4>Frau<else>Herr</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Ich stehe bereit, um Euch jede gewünschte Art von Manderville-Waffe anzufertigen.
#. fr: Ravi de vous revoir, <if $gn4>Dame<else>Messire</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>. Vous souhaitez fabriquer une nouvelle arme des Manderville, n'est-ce pas<nbsp>? Tout est prêt, il ne nous manque plus que <noun-fr Item 2 38420 2 1>.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_CRAFTER04653_000_000:1"
msgid "Greetings and salutations, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>! I stand willing and able to aid you in the creation of any Manderville weaponry you may desire."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 申し訳ありませんが、<br>「<sheet Item 38420 0>」は集めていただく必要があります。<br>3個、持ってきてもらえればすぐに製作するんで、お願いします！
#. de: Bevor ich jedoch mit Eurer Anfrage beginnen kann, muss ich Euch bitten, mir die erforderliche Menge an Manderium-Meteoriten zu liefern. Drei feste Brocken von dem Zeug, um genau zu sein.
#. fr: Merci de bien vouloir m'en apporter trois, afin de procéder à l'extraction d'huile d'exadamanderville<nbsp>!
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_CRAFTER04653_000_001:1"
msgid "Before we can fulfill your request, however, I must ask that you provide me with the necessary quantity of manderium meteorite. Three solid chunks of the stuff, to be precise."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 38420 0>」は、<br>エーテライト・プラザにいる「ジュブルンナ」から、<br>交換できます。
#. de: Manderium-Meteoritenbrocken können bei Jubrunnah am Ätherytenplatz in Radz-at-Han erworben werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez obtenir des <noun-fr Item 12 38420 2 1> auprès de Jubrunnah sur la place de l'Éthérite.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_SYSTEM_100_001:1"
msgid "Chunks of manderium meteorite can be obtained from Jubrunnah at the aetheryte plaza in Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 38420 0>」は集まりましたか？<br>……どうやら、まだみたいですね。<br>大丈夫です、製作の準備をして待ってますから！
#. de: Macht Ihr Fortschritte beim Erwerb der Manderium-Meteoritenbrocken? ... Oh, es ist also noch in Arbeit. Keine Sorge! Ich werde mir die Wartezeit damit versüßen, mir all die Möglichkeiten auszumalen, wie ich meinen beträchtlichen Vorschuss ausgeben könnte.
#. fr: Vous avez réussi à mettre la main sur les morceaux de météorite<nbsp>? Ah... pas encore, j'en ai bien peur. Ne vous inquiétez pas, je vous attendrai aussi longtemps que nécessaire.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_CRAFTER04653_150_001:1"
msgid "How fare your efforts to acquire the manderium meteorite? ...Ah, still a work in progress, I see. Not to worry! I shall endure the tedium of waiting by imagining all the ways I might spend my substantial retainer's fee."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 38420 0>」は、<br>エーテライト・プラザにいる「ジュブルンナ」から、<br>交換できます。
#. de: Manderium-Meteoritenbrocken können bei Jubrunnah am Ätherytenplatz in Radz-at-Han erworben werden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez obtenir des <noun-fr Item 12 38420 2 1> auprès de Jubrunnah sur la place de l'Éthérite.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_SYSTEM_160_001:1"
msgid "Chunks of manderium meteorite can be obtained from Jubrunnah at the aetheryte plaza in Radz<hyphen>at<hyphen>Han."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<sheet Item 38420 0>」は集まりましたか？
#. de: Habt Ihr etwas für mich, <if $gn4>Frau<else>Herr</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>?
#. fr: Vous avez obtenu ce que je vous ai demandé, <if $gn4>Dame<else>Messire</if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>?
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
#. macro: <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 2><string $gs1></split> — the last name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_CRAFTER04653_000_0010:1"
msgid "You have something for me, <if $gn4>Mistress<else>Master</if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: バッチリ、集まりましたね！<br>抽出最後の工程も準備に問題なしです。<br>ゲロルトさんに声をかけて、製作を始めましょう！
#. de: Ah, die Meteoritenbrocken! Der Extraktionsprozess sollte nur einen Augenblick dauern, daher werde ich Meister Gerolt bitten, seinen Amboss bereit zu machen.
#. fr: Parfait<nbsp>! Exactement ce qu'il me fallait<nbsp>! Le processus d'extraction de l'huile ne devrait pas prendre trop longtemps, je vais indiquer à maître Gerolt de se tenir prêt pour la suite des opérations.
#. speaker: CRAFTER04653
msgctxt "quest/046/ChrHdy151_04653:TEXT_CHRHDY151_04653_CRAFTER04653_000_0011:1"
msgid "Ah, yes, the meteorite chunks! I certainly wasn't expecting a Hannish curry and a bottle of chilled lassi, no indeed... Ahem, the extraction process should take but a moment, so I shall call upon Master Gerolt to have his anvil ready."
msgstr ""

#. ja: よし、できたぞ！<br>ソイツがお前のマンダヴィルウェポン……
#. de: Ein weiteres Meisterwerk!
#. fr: Et voilà<nbsp>! Un autre chef-d'œuvre signé Gerolt<nbsp>!
#. speaker: GEROLT
